{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:f4cbfc58a683894a66b028420969bb75a35fe4acda1bd3dce0024062c11b2041", "sample_idx": 29, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "\"To access the print version of the article, a link is provided. The rules for the Sudoku puzzle are explained, with a notable exception being that the numbers in cells contained within grey lines must add up to the figures in the corner. This means that the sum of the numbers in these cells is crucial to solving the puzzle. The standard Sudoku rule of not repeating numbers within each shape formed by grey lines still applies, adding a layer of complexity to the puzzle.\"\n\n\n \nAddition to the standard Sudoku rules, the numbers in the grey-lined cells have a unique requirement. They must sum up to the numbers indicated in the corner of the puzzle. This adds an extra level of challenge and requires careful consideration of the numbers used in each section. The puzzle requires a strategic approach to ensure that the sums are correct and that no numbers are repeated within each shape.\n\n\n \nThe Sudoku puzzle is a challenging and engaging activity that requires focus and attention to detail. The use of grey lines to indicate the sections where numbers must sum up to the corner figures adds a new level of complexity. The puzzle is designed to be solved using logic and reasoning, making it a fun and stimulating activity for those who enjoy problem-solving.\n\n\n \nThe completed puzzle will be available in next week's Observer Digital Edition. This provides a chance for readers to check their answers and see the solution to the puzzle. The puzzle is a great way to exercise the brain and improve cognitive skills, making it a worthwhile activity for people of all ages. The unique rules and challenging layout make it a standout puzzle that is sure to provide hours of entertainment.\n\n\n \nThe Observer Digital Edition is a great resource for those who enjoy puzzles and games. The inclusion of the Sudoku puzzle with its unique rules and challenging layout makes it a must-have for fans of the game. The edition provides a convenient way to access the puzzle and check the answers, making it a great option for those who want to stay entertained and engaged. The puzzle is just one example of the many great features and activities that can be found in the Observer Digital Edition.", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.4018803536891937}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305700585246086}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0232519693672657}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.008725020103156567}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0031777145341038704}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011118361726403236}, {"token": " article", "logprob": -0.2270030528306961}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.002512990264222026}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.024781323969364166}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.008299149572849274}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.0067192567512393}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -0.00012361239350866526}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.31154054403305054}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.0039595551788806915}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.11019902676343918}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.02659463882446289}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.8281631469726562}, {"token": " Sudoku", "logprob": -0.047784850001335144}, {"token": " puzzle", "logprob": -0.0014821031363680959}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.0006300609675236046}, {"token": " explained", "logprob": -0.4565137028694153}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -5.864924969500862e-05}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.06154264509677887}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.009080659598112106}, {"token": " notable", "logprob": -1.6899785995483398}, {"token": " exception", "logprob": -0.00020346954988781363}, {"token": " being", "logprob": -1.873063325881958}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.1602521389722824}, {"token": " the", "lo